      "content": "a \"permanent cut\"? i don't know. it feels like the math just doesn't work anymore. even if i cut expenses, the debt is always there, waiting for me. it's like the only way to actually win against a system like this is to just stop playing the game entirely. like, if the only outcome is more debt and more tiredness, is there even a reason to keep participating?",
